{
    "_comment": "Route-A native-skeleton retargeter config (mydata -> hightorque_pi_plus_s). ik_map keys are YOUR BVH joint names (see my_data/man_pabox_B_001.bvh); t_body/r_body targets are the Pi Plus S robot links (same links as soma_to_pi_plus_s_retargeter_config.json). Name equivalences vs SOMA: Chest->Spine3, LeftLeg(thigh)->LeftUpLeg, LeftShin->LeftLeg, RightLeg->RightUpLeg, RightShin->RightLeg. joint_scales/joint_offsets start neutral; populate them with the in-app Calibration panel.",

